    {
      "position": 8,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Examples #431, and #432 do not belong in this category. A rough translation of this grammar *is* \"because,\" but the type of reasons before ことから are more specific, and a similar expression is ので.",
      "html": "Examples #431, and #432 do not belong in this category. A rough translation of this grammar *is* \"because,\" but the type of reasons before ことから are more specific, and a similar expression is ので.",
